| Selenium pattern | Playwright replacement |
|---|---|
| `WebDriverWait(...).until(visibility_of_element_located(...))`, then typing | `getByLabel(...).fill(...)` |
| Waiting for a clickable submit button | `getByRole(...).click()` |
